ll. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_Theatre_(Cartagena)]; It was sited so that it could be seen from the sea. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_Theatre_(Cartagena)]; The theatre seated some 6,000. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_Theatre_(Cartagena)]; A fire destroyed much of the theatre''s structure. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_Theatre_(Cartagena)]; After the fire, its remains were dismantled and the elements used to build a market. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_Theatre_(Cartagena)]"}]'::jsonb),
